WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.157
Welcome to Module 13.

00:00:02.157 --> 00:00:11.102
Statistics helps us summarize evidence, and visualization helps us communicate patterns in a form people can understand

00:00:11.102 --> 00:00:12.897
quickly.

00:00:12.897 --> 00:00:21.354
We’ll work with center, spread, distributions, group comparisons, correlation, uncertainty, and basic visual choices.

00:00:21.852 --> 00:00:24.964
The most important habit is interpretation.

00:00:24.964 --> 00:00:30.773
A statistic is useful only when we can explain what it means in the context of the data.
